{"title":"UI/UX Engineer Roadmap","role":"UI/UX Engineer","summary":"A UI/UX Engineer combines user experience design, interface design, frontend development, and software engineering to create digital products that are visually effective, accessible, responsive, and technically implementable.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Computer Science & Design (CSD)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A UI/UX Engineer combines user experience design, interface design, frontend development, and software engineering to create digital products that are visually effective, accessible, responsive, and technically implementable."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a pure UI/UX Designer, a UI/UX Engineer is expected to understand how designs translate into real production interfaces."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research user needs and behavior"},{"text":"Design user journeys and information architecture"},{"text":"Create wireframes and prototypes"},{"text":"Develop design systems"},{"text":"Design responsive interfaces"},{"text":"Implement interfaces using HTML/CSS/JavaScript"},{"text":"Build React-based UI components"},{"text":"Collaborate with designers, product managers and developers"},{"text":"Conduct usability testing"},{"text":"Improve accessibility and performance"},{"text":"Translate Figma designs into production code"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Direction","Example Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"UI Engineering"},{"text":"UI Engineer, Frontend Engineer"}],[{"text":"UX Engineering"},{"text":"UX Engineer, UX Developer"}],[{"text":"Product Design"},{"text":"Product Designer, Digital Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Design Systems"},{"text":"Design Systems Engineer"}],[{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"Interaction Designer"}],[{"text":"Frontend Development"},{"