vement into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"Product Strategy"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Technology Management"},{"text":"For pure UX specialization, M.Des/HCI can be more directly aligned than another general computer science degree."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible specializations include:"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"UI Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Frontend Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Systems Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Accessibility Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Design"},{"type":"h","text":"AI UX Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Developer Experience (DX)"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Motion & Interaction Design"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech CSD","UI/UX / Frontend Intern","UI/UX Engineer","UX Engineer / Frontend Engineer","Senior UX/UI Engineer","Staff / Lead UX Engineer","Principal UX Engineer / Design Engineering Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative design-oriented pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["UI/UX Engineer","Senior UX Engineer","Product Designer / Design Technologist","Lead Product Designer","Design Engineering / UX Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern UI/UX Engineer should track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-native interfaces"},{"text":"Agentic UI"},{"text":"Generative UI"},{"text":"Voice interfaces"},{"text":"Multimodal interfaces"},{"text":"Spatial computing"},{"text":"AR/VR interfaces"},{"text":"Design-to-code systems"},{"text":"AI coding agents"},{"text":"AI-assisted UX research"},{"text":"Design system automation"},{"text":"WebGPU"},{"text":"Advanced data visualization"},{"text":"Accessibility automation"},{"text":"Adaptive interfaces"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["Figma","UX Research","Interaction Design","Design Systems","Prototyping"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Frontend"},{"type":"flow","items":["HTML","CSS","JavaScript","TypeScript","React","Next.js"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"flow","items":["Git","REST APIs","Testing","Performance","Accessibility"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"flow","items":["User Research","Product Analytics","A/B Testing","Product Thinking"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"flow","items":["Storybook","Design Tokens","Component Architecture","AI UX","Design-to-Code"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conduct basic user research"},{"text":"Create user flows"},{"text":"Build wireframes"},{"text":"Design high-fidelity interfaces"},{"text":"Create interactive Figma prototypes"},{"text":"Build reusable design systems"},{"text":"Convert Figma designs into React applications"},{"text":"Write production-quality TypeScript"},{"text":"Build responsive interfaces"},{"text":"Integrate APIs"},{"text":"Implement accessibility"},{"text":"Test frontend applications"},{"text":"Optimize web performance"},{"text":"Analyze user behavior"},{"text":"Deploy applications"},{"text":"Document design decisions"},{"text":"Collaborate with developers, designers and product managers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio Target"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation:"},{"type":"h","text":"3–5 strong UX case studies"},{"type":"h","text":"3–4 production-quality frontend projects"},{"type":"h","text":"1 complete design system"},{"type":"h","text":"1 accessibility-focused project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 AI-enabled interface"},{"type":"h","text":"1 major end-to-end product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"